{"duration_api_ms":3842,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c993dbd3-f0cd-454b-8c2f-7c100a1cedf9","total_cost_usd":0.0008735,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1129,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":940,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":517},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1129,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1129,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1129},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1672,"outputTokens":961,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1129,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0008735,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":517,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":1129,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Sponsor economics**\n- **Breakeven AUM:** Compare expected fee revenue (AUM × net expense ratio) with fixed costs: audit, legal, fund accounting, index licensing, exchange listing, compliance, and board fees.\n- **Fee waivers and expense caps:** Check how long costs are absorbed and what happens when caps expire.\n- **Lineup economics:** Determine whether other funds share overhead and whether a weak fund drains resources from stronger ones.\n\n**Seed capital**\n- **Seed size, source, duration:** Note whether seed is sponsor- or third-party-funded and how long it's committed.\n- **Seed-to-flows ratio:** Track how organic inflows replace seed. Long-unredeemed seed signals weak demand.\n- **Seed concentration:** Watch for one holder controlling a large share of assets.\n\n**Growth and viability**\n- **Net flows vs. market returns:** Separate asset growth from inflows.\n- **Distribution access:** Track platform, model, and advisor adoption.\n- **Trading activity:** Monitor volume, spreads, creation/redemption activity, and authorized participant count.\n\n**Closure triggers:** Review the board's minimum-AUM policy and any stated liquidation thresholds.","ttft_ms":2162,"type":"result","duration_ms":3313,"uuid":"13a22145-7b98-485f-a483-2feaef421cec","ttft_stream_ms":482,"time_to_request_ms":69,"first_content_frame_ms":482,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
